OL,3,AMonty Don bids 'final goodbye' to
OL,4,AGardeners' World after two decades
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring the episode, Don, 71, confirmed
OL,7,Fhe would remain part of the presenting
OL,8,Fline-up for next year's Royal
OL,9,FHorticultural Society (RHS) Chelsea
OL,10,FFlower Show.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
